{"name": "Welcome to Harmony", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras_big/e4345c0afe2df4cd55c0f71016a893c2.webp?t=1785175216\" height=\"530\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/e4345c0afe2df4cd55c0f71016a893c2.avif?t=1785175216\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summer in Harmony was supposed to be simple. Treehouses, comic books, and long days with nowhere to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Then Harmony Industries changed everything.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the incident, the town began to shift in subtle, unsettling ways. Streets became unfamiliar. Neighbors aren\u2019t themselves. With each passing day, the weirdness spreads.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Welcome to Harmony, you play as Mikey, a kid fighting his way across a town slowly slipping into something darker. Searching for answers, trying to reach dad, and uncovering the truth behind what Harmony Industries unleashed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras_big/efe7f40707e22b0d1cfad8caf1405246.webp?t=1785175216\" height=\"955\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/efe7f40707e22b0d1cfad8caf1405246.avif?t=1785175216\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your Deck. Prepare to Adapt.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your character. Choose your starting cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck with new cards, upgrades, modifiers, permanent gear, and timely snacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knowing when to pivot your build against a shifting town is how you survive until the lights come on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/fee2fe81c54e8670abf86525546ab004.poster.avif?t=1785175216\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/fee2fe81c54e8670abf86525546ab004.webm?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/fee2fe81c54e8670abf86525546ab004.mp4?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plan Your Timeline. Execute Everything.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies telegraph their actions. Strategically place your cards to respond.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/26e1f99613452fbb13bf1de1e63e5015.poster.avif?t=1785175216\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/26e1f99613452fbb13bf1de1e63e5015.webm?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/26e1f99613452fbb13bf1de1e63e5015.mp4?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When ready, lock it in. Once the timeline executes, there's no stopping it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sequencing, synergies, and knowing when to adapt are what separate good runs from great ones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/89692b86f911282588a825bb5734f43a.poster.avif?t=1785175216\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/89692b86f911282588a825bb5734f43a.webm?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/89692b86f911282588a825bb5734f43a.mp4?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Navigate the Neighborhood. Roll the Dice.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play it safe by moving one space at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or roll the die to push ahead and claim vital nodes from the suburbs to downtown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balancing guaranteed movement against the luck of the roll separates a dangerous detour from a flawless run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/91b7c0715072728b46b27b207bf955d4.poster.avif?t=1785175216\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/91b7c0715072728b46b27b207bf955d4.webm?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/91b7c0715072728b46b27b207bf955d4.mp4?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fail and Doom the Future.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every choice, every card played, and every roll determines the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive today or lose everything to a desolate tomorrow that should never exist.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/3ed98974b7d0ad42053da1d280e9659b.poster.avif?t=1785175216\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/3ed98974b7d0ad42053da1d280e9659b.webm?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/extras/3ed98974b7d0ad42053da1d280e9659b.mp4?t=1785175216\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build your timeline, adapt your strategy, and execute your plan to survive the town of Harmony as it slowly slips into something darker in this 3D deckbuilding roguelite.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447030/c8587e54f9fe99c91d2578edbfef47668089df86/header.jpg?t=1785175216", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Deckbuilding", "Roguelite", "Strategy", "Card Battler", "Turn-Based Combat", "RPG"], "developers": "Doom Turtle", "publishers": "Doom Turtle", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4447030", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/09g_Ww1phvw", "first_seen": 1772492400.0, "review_rank": 1052}